    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_use" kindref="compound">Use</ref> represents the edge between a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref> definition and its users. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is notionally a two-dimensional linked list. It supports traversing all of the uses for a particular value definition. It also supports jumping directly to the used value when we arrive from the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_user" kindref="compound">User</ref>&apos;s operands, and jumping directly to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_user" kindref="compound">User</ref> when we arrive from the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref>&apos;s uses. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
